    order: 3
  - id: 4
    chapter: 1
    required: 1
    title: An Lac Security Desk Log
    summary: "02:40 \u2014 Received AL-04 under seal K6 for group C12. Public admissions
      are suspended; technical intake continues through the service entrance. Record
      P046 against the receiving time, not the earlier appointment time. The upper
      records room holds the intake sheet. Access requires lower service power; the
      replacement fuse is in ground-floor maintenance storage. No patient has been
      discharged through this desk tonight. Staff asking for the public lift must
      be redirected to security. Marcus Hale instructed us to keep both the public
      log and technical supplement. The contractor asked for only the public log."
    body: "02:40 \u2014 Received AL-04 under seal K6 for group C12. Public admissions
      are suspended; technical intake continues through the service entrance. Record
      P046 against the receiving time, not the earlier appointment time. The upper
      records room holds the intake sheet. Access requires lower service power; the
      replacement fuse is in ground-floor maintenance storage. No patient has been
      discharged through this desk tonight. Staff asking for the public lift must
      be redirected to security. Marcus Hale instructed us to keep both the public
      log and technical supplement. The contractor asked for only the public log."
    bodyVietnamese: "02:40 \u2014 Nh\u1EADn AL-04, ni\xEAm phong K6 cho nh\xF3m C12.
      Ng\u1EEBng ti\u1EBFp nh\u1EADn c\xF4ng khai; ti\u1EBFp nh\u1EADn k\u1EF9 thu\u1EADt
      v\u1EABn ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c qua c\u1EEDa d\u1ECBch v\u1EE5. Ghi P046 theo gi\u1EDD
      nh\u1EADn th\u1EF1c t\u1EBF, kh\xF4ng theo gi\u1EDD h\u1EB9n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      \u0111\xF3. Phi\u1EBFu ti\u1EBFp nh\u1EADn n\u1EB1m trong ph\xF2ng h\u1ED3
      s\u01A1 t\u1EA7ng tr\xEAn. C\u1EA7n ngu\u1ED3n d\u1ECBch v\u1EE5 t\u1EA7ng
      d\u01B0\u1EDBi \u0111\u1EC3 v\xE0o; c\u1EA7u ch\xEC thay th\u1EBF \u1EDF kho
      b\u1EA3o tr\xEC t\u1EA7ng tr\u1EC7t. \u0110\xEAm nay kh\xF4ng b\u1EC7nh nh\xE2n
      n\xE0o \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c xu\u1EA5t vi\u1EC7n qua qu\u1EA7y. Nh\xE2n vi\xEAn
      h\u1ECFi thang c\xF4ng c\u1ED9ng ph\u1EA3i t\u1EDBi an ninh. Marcus Hale y\xEAu
      c\u1EA7u gi\u1EEF c\u1EA3 s\u1ED5 c\xF4ng khai v\xE0 ph\u1EE5 l\u1EE5c k\u1EF9
      thu\u1EADt. Nh\xE0 th\u1EA7u ch\u1EC9 y\xEAu c\u1EA7u s\u1ED5 c\xF4ng khai."
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6dda5a7e72c37ac4c92f1e6cc411bec0, type: 3}
    preview: {fileID: 0}
    autoDiscoverAfter: 8
    order: 4
  - id: 5
    chapter: 1
    required: 1
    title: P046 Intake Record
    summary: 'Patient reference P046. Intake group C12. Receiving time 02:40. Linked
      consignment AL-04, lot T9-17. Observation status: fever and disorientation
      following the T-9 exposure protocol. Dr. Adrian Cole has requested immediate
      suspension of further exposure; approval remains unsigned. The public status
      reads RECOVERY TRANSFER. The internal destination reads B2 TECHNICAL OBSERVATION.
      Do not substitute P041, whose C08 intake was logged at 01:20. Family contact
      requests are held by administration. This sheet must accompany any movement
      order so that the receiving team can reconcile the patient reference with the
      original identity register.'
    body: 'Patient reference P046. Intake group C12. Receiving time 02:40. Linked
      consignment AL-04, lot T9-17. Observation status: fever and disorientation
      following the T-9 exposure protocol. Dr. Adrian Cole has requested immediate
      suspension of further exposure; approval remains unsigned. The public status
      reads RECOVERY TRANSFER. The internal destination reads B2 TECHNICAL OBSERVATION.
      Do not substitute P041, whose C08 intake was logged at 01:20. Family contact
      requests are held by administration. This sheet must accompany any movement
      order so that the receiving team can reconcile the patient reference with the
      original identity register.'
    bodyVietnamese: "M\xE3 b\u1EC7nh nh\xE2n P046. Nh\xF3m C12. Gi\u1EDD nh\u1EADn
      02:40. Chuy\u1EBFn li\xEAn quan AL-04, l\xF4 T9-17. Theo d\xF5i: s\u1ED1t v\xE0
      m\u1EA5t \u0111\u1ECBnh h\u01B0\u1EDBng sau quy tr\xECnh ph\u01A1i nhi\u1EC5m
      T-9. Dr. Adrian Cole y\xEAu c\u1EA7u d\u1EEBng ngay vi\u1EC7c ph\u01A1i nhi\u1EC5m
      b\u1ED5 sung; ph\xEA duy\u1EC7t ch\u01B0a \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c k\xFD. Tr\u1EA1ng
      th\xE1i c\xF4ng khai ghi CHUY\u1EC2N PH\u1EE4C H\u1ED2I. \u0110\u1ECBa ch\u1EC9
      n\u1ED9i b\u1ED9 ghi THEO D\xD5I K\u1EF8 THU\u1EACT B2. Kh\xF4ng nh\u1EA7m
      v\u1EDBi P041 thu\u1ED9c C08, ti\u1EBFp nh\u1EADn l\xFAc 01:20. Y\xEAu c\u1EA7u
      li\xEAn h\u1EC7 gia \u0111\xECnh do h\xE0nh ch\xEDnh gi\u1EEF. Phi\u1EBFu n\xE0y
      ph\u1EA3i \u0111i c\xF9ng l\u1EC7nh chuy\u1EC3n \u0111\u1EC3 n\u01A1i nh\u1EADn
      \u0111\u1ED1i chi\u1EBFu m\xE3 b\u1EC7nh nh\xE2n v\u1EDBi danh t\xEDnh g\u1ED1c."
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6dda5a7e72c37ac4c92f1e6cc411bec0, type: 3}
    preview: {fileID: 0}
    autoDiscoverAfter: 12
    order: 5
  - id: 6
    chapter: 1
    required: 1
    title: Mortuary Transfer Discrepancy
    summary: "P046 / C12. Mortuary entry: deceased, 03:05. Freight movement entry:
      living subject for B2 observation, 03:50. Both entries use the same patient
      reference and receiving wristband; this is not a second patient. The assigned
      mortuary drawer is empty. Maya Reed's lift note confirms the later trip carried
      an occupied observation trolley. The B2 access card is retained with this discrepancy
      report for an independent check. Do not resolve the conflict by deleting either
      entry. Whoever examines the records must see that a live transfer was logged
      after the reported death. \u2014 Security review copy."
    body: "P046 / C12. Mortuary entry: deceased, 03:05. Freight movement entry: living
      subject for B2 observation, 03:50. Both entries use the same patient reference
      and receiving wristband; this is not a second patient. The assigned mortuary
      drawer is empty. Maya Reed's lift note confirms the later trip carried an occupied
      observation trolley. The B2 access card is retained with this discrepancy report
      for an independent check. Do not resolve the conflict by deleting either entry.
      Whoever examines the records must see that a live transfer was logged after
      the reported death. \u2014 Security review copy."
    bodyVietnamese: "P046 / C12. S\u1ED5 nh\xE0 x\xE1c: t\u1EED vong, 03:05. S\u1ED5
      v\u1EADn chuy\u1EC3n: \u0111\u1ED1i t\u01B0\u1EE3ng c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng \u0111i
      theo d\xF5i t\u1EA1i B2, 03:50. Hai m\u1EE5c d\xF9ng c\xF9ng m\xE3 b\u1EC7nh
      nh\xE2n v\xE0 v\xF2ng nh\u1EADn d\u1EA1ng, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i hai ng\u01B0\u1EDDi.
      Ng\u0103n nh\xE0 x\xE1c \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u1ECBnh \u0111ang
      tr\u1ED1ng. Ghi ch\xFA thang c\u1EE7a Maya Reed x\xE1c nh\u1EADn chuy\u1EBFn
      sau ch\u1EDF xe theo d\xF5i c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi. Th\u1EBB B2 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      gi\u1EEF c\xF9ng b\xE1o c\xE1o \u0111\u1EC3 ki\u1EC3m tra \u0111\u1ED9c l\u1EADp.
      Kh\xF4ng gi\u1EA3i quy\u1EBFt m\xE2u thu\u1EABn b\u1EB1ng c\xE1ch x\xF3a m\u1ED9t
      m\u1EE5c. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi xem ph\u1EA3i bi\u1EBFt l\u1EA7n chuy\u1EC3n c\xF2n
      s\u1ED1ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ghi sau gi\u1EDD t\u1EED vong. \u2014 B\u1EA3n
      th\u1EA9m tra an ninh."
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0d58bdec2258a564facd2e9f32be26ed, type: 3}
    preview: {fileID: 0}
    autoDiscoverAfter: 13
    order: 6
  - id: 7
    chapter: 2
    required: 1
    title: B2 Archive Index
    summary: Restricted index, revision before contractor export. Trace lot T9-17
      to intake group C12 and patient P046. The corresponding original archive is
      E-02. E-01 belongs to an earlier shipment and cannot establish this chain.
      E-03 is an equipment record without patient identities. The contractor export
      of E-02 excludes the identity table and Adrian Cole's stop-work request. Preserve
      the original directory, not just its export. Power the data path before opening
      the archive terminal. Security has placed the original under hold so that an
      outside investigator can compare what was recorded with what the client intended
      to receive.
    body: Restricted index, revision before contractor export. Trace lot T9-17 to
      intake group C12 and patient P046. The corresponding original archive is E-02.
      E-01 belongs to an earlier shipment and cannot establish this chain. E-03 is
      an equipment record without patient identities. The contractor export of E-02
      excludes the identity table and Adrian Cole's stop-work request. Preserve the
      original directory, not just its export. Power the data path before opening
      the archive terminal. Security has placed the original under hold so that an
      outside investigator can compare what was recorded with what the client intended
      to receive.
    bodyVietnamese: "Ch\u1EC9 m\u1EE5c h\u1EA1n ch\u1EBF, phi\xEAn b\u1EA3n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      khi xu\u1EA5t cho nh\xE0 th\u1EA7u. \u0110\u1ED1i chi\u1EBFu l\xF4 T9-17 v\u1EDBi
      nh\xF3m C12 v\xE0 b\u1EC7nh nh\xE2n P046. H\u1ED3 s\u01A1 g\u1ED1c t\u01B0\u01A1ng
      \u1EE9ng l\xE0 E-02. E-01 thu\u1ED9c l\xF4 tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, kh\xF4ng ch\u1EE9ng
      minh chu\u1ED7i n\xE0y. E-03 l\xE0 h\u1ED3 s\u01A1 thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB kh\xF4ng
      c\xF3 danh t\xEDnh b\u1EC7nh nh\xE2n. B\u1EA3n E-02 c\u1EE7a nh\xE0 th\u1EA7u
      lo\u1EA1i b\u1EA3ng danh t\xEDnh v\xE0 y\xEAu c\u1EA7u d\u1EEBng c\u1EE7a Adrian
      Cole. Ph\u1EA3i gi\u1EEF th\u01B0 m\u1EE5c g\u1ED1c, kh\xF4ng ch\u1EC9 b\u1EA3n
      xu\u1EA5t. C\u1EA5p ngu\u1ED3n \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      khi m\u1EDF m\xE1y l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF. An ninh gi\u1EEF b\u1EA3n g\u1ED1c \u0111\u1EC3
      \u0111i\u1EC1u tra vi\xEAn b\xEAn ngo\xE0i so s\xE1nh d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u th\u1EF1c
      t\u1EBF v\u1EDBi th\u1EE9 kh\xE1ch h\xE0ng \u0111\u1ECBnh nh\u1EADn."
    audio: {fileID: 0}
