  - id: 10
    chapter: 0
    required: 0
    title: Unsent Factory Letter
    summary: Ellie, I traded shifts again. Please do not wait at the bus stop tonight.
      They keep adding a sealed delivery after the ordinary trucks leave, and somebody
      has to stay with the temperature recorder until security signs. I used to know
      every driver by name. Now they speak to a caller before they speak to us. There
      is soup in the blue container, not the one with the cracked lid. Tell Ben I
      have not forgotten his Saturday match. I will come home when they let the last
      truck through.
    body: Ellie, I traded shifts again. Please do not wait at the bus stop tonight.
      They keep adding a sealed delivery after the ordinary trucks leave, and somebody
      has to stay with the temperature recorder until security signs. I used to know
      every driver by name. Now they speak to a caller before they speak to us. There
      is soup in the blue container, not the one with the cracked lid. Tell Ben I
      have not forgotten his Saturday match. I will come home when they let the last
      truck through.
    bodyVietnamese: "Ellie, anh l\u1EA1i \u0111\u1ED5i ca. \u0110\u1EEBng \u0111\u1EE3i
      \u1EDF tr\u1EA1m xe bu\xFDt t\u1ED1i nay. H\u1ECD c\u1EE9 th\xEAm chuy\u1EBFn
      ni\xEAm phong sau khi xe th\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111i h\u1EBFt, v\xE0 ph\u1EA3i
      c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi tr\xF4ng m\xE1y ghi nhi\u1EC7t t\u1EDBi l\xFAc an ninh
      k\xFD. Tr\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\xE2y anh bi\u1EBFt t\xEAn m\u1ECDi t\xE0i x\u1EBF.
      Gi\u1EDD h\u1ECD n\xF3i v\u1EDBi m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi g\u1ECDi \u0111i\u1EC7n
      tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi n\xF3i v\u1EDBi b\u1ECDn anh. S\xFAp \u1EDF h\u1ED9p xanh,
      kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i h\u1ED9p n\u1EE9t n\u1EAFp. N\xF3i v\u1EDBi Ben anh ch\u01B0a
      qu\xEAn tr\u1EADn th\u1EE9 b\u1EA3y. Anh s\u1EBD v\u1EC1 khi h\u1ECD cho chi\u1EBFc
      xe cu\u1ED1i qua."
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6dda5a7e72c37ac4c92f1e6cc411bec0, type: 3}
    preview: {fileID: 0}
