  - id: 12
    chapter: 0
    required: 0
    title: Cold Store Return Memo
    summary: "Security desk \u2014 Marcus Hale. The returned T9-17 case remains sealed.
      Photograph the seal before storage and attach the failed delivery receipt;
      do not classify it as unused stock. A caller asked whether destroying the temperature
      strip would simplify the return. I declined and recorded the call reference.
      Refrigeration is a custody requirement, not proof that the contents are safe.
      No factory employee is authorized to inspect the sample. If the client sends
      a replacement manifest, keep both versions. A cleaner document is not necessarily
      a more truthful one."
    body: "Security desk \u2014 Marcus Hale. The returned T9-17 case remains sealed.
      Photograph the seal before storage and attach the failed delivery receipt;
      do not classify it as unused stock. A caller asked whether destroying the temperature
      strip would simplify the return. I declined and recorded the call reference.
      Refrigeration is a custody requirement, not proof that the contents are safe.
      No factory employee is authorized to inspect the sample. If the client sends
      a replacement manifest, keep both versions. A cleaner document is not necessarily
      a more truthful one."
    bodyVietnamese: "B\xE0n an ninh \u2014 Marcus Hale. Ki\u1EC7n T9-17 tr\u1EA3
      v\u1EC1 v\u1EABn ni\xEAm phong. Ch\u1EE5p ni\xEAm phong tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi
      l\u01B0u kho, k\xE8m bi\xEAn nh\u1EADn giao th\u1EA5t b\u1EA1i; kh\xF4ng x\u1EBFp
      v\xE0o h\xE0ng ch\u01B0a d\xF9ng. C\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi h\u1ECFi h\u1EE7y d\u1EA3i
      nhi\u1EC7t c\xF3 \u0111\u01A1n gi\u1EA3n h\xF3a vi\u1EC7c tr\u1EA3 h\xE0ng
      kh\xF4ng. T\xF4i t\u1EEB ch\u1ED1i v\xE0 ghi m\xE3 cu\u1ED9c g\u1ECDi. Gi\u1EEF
      l\u1EA1nh l\xE0 y\xEAu c\u1EA7u b\u1EA3o qu\u1EA3n ch\u1EE9ng c\u1EE9, kh\xF4ng
      ch\u1EE9ng minh n\u1ED9i dung an to\xE0n. Nh\xE2n vi\xEAn nh\xE0 m\xE1y kh\xF4ng
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ki\u1EC3m tra m\u1EABu. N\u1EBFu kh\xE1ch g\u1EEDi v\u1EADn
      \u0111\u01A1n thay th\u1EBF, gi\u1EEF c\u1EA3 hai. H\u1ED3 s\u01A1 s\u1EA1ch
      h\u01A1n ch\u01B0a ch\u1EAFc th\u1EADt h\u01A1n."
    audio: {fileID: 0}
