  - id: 14
    chapter: 1
    required: 0
    title: A Letter Never Delivered
    summary: Dear Daniel, the receptionist said your room changed and that visiting
      would resume next week. I left the photograph anyway. Your brother insists
      the dog recognizes you in it, which sounds impossible, but I am choosing to
      believe him. They would not let me leave your own blanket because everything
      has to be issued by the ward. I have written our number again on the back.
      You do not need to explain why you missed the call. Just ask someone to tell
      us which room you are in now. Love, Anna.
    body: Dear Daniel, the receptionist said your room changed and that visiting
      would resume next week. I left the photograph anyway. Your brother insists
      the dog recognizes you in it, which sounds impossible, but I am choosing to
      believe him. They would not let me leave your own blanket because everything
      has to be issued by the ward. I have written our number again on the back.
      You do not need to explain why you missed the call. Just ask someone to tell
      us which room you are in now. Love, Anna.
    bodyVietnamese: "Daniel th\xE2n m\u1EBFn, l\u1EC5 t\xE2n n\xF3i con \u0111\u1ED5i
      ph\xF2ng v\xE0 tu\u1EA7n sau s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u0103m. M\u1EB9
      v\u1EABn \u0111\u1EC3 l\u1EA1i \u1EA3nh. Em con kh\u0103ng kh\u0103ng con ch\xF3
      nh\u1EADn ra con trong \u1EA3nh; nghe kh\xF3 tin nh\u01B0ng m\u1EB9 mu\u1ED1n
      tin. H\u1ECD kh\xF4ng cho \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u0103n c\u1EE7a con v\xEC m\u1ECDi
      th\u1EE9 ph\u1EA3i do khoa c\u1EA5p. M\u1EB9 ghi l\u1EA1i s\u1ED1 nh\xE0 ph\xEDa
      sau. Con kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n gi\u1EA3i th\xEDch v\xEC sao l\u1EE1 cu\u1ED9c g\u1ECDi.
      Ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n nh\u1EDD ai n\xF3i cho nh\xE0 m\xECnh bi\u1EBFt gi\u1EDD
      con \u1EDF ph\xF2ng n\xE0o. Y\xEAu con, Anna."
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6dda5a7e72c37ac4c92f1e6cc411bec0, type: 3}
    preview: {fileID: 0}
    autoDiscoverAfter: 0
    order: 14
  - id: 15
    chapter: 1
    required: 0
    title: B2 Lift Maintenance Card
    summary: "Service entry \u2014 Maya Reed. The freight lift answered a lower-floor
      call after the public closure notice went up. That is not a fault: B2 remains
      connected to the emergency circuit. I replaced the landing lamp, not the card
      reader. Stop requesting a master bypass; the card is held by security for a
      reason. On descent, wait for the receiving door to finish opening before unloading.
      The cabin cannot safely carry a trolley across a half-open threshold. Leave
      this card at the panel so the next shift knows what was actually repaired."
    body: "Service entry \u2014 Maya Reed. The freight lift answered a lower-floor
      call after the public closure notice went up. That is not a fault: B2 remains
      connected to the emergency circuit. I replaced the landing lamp, not the card
      reader. Stop requesting a master bypass; the card is held by security for a
      reason. On descent, wait for the receiving door to finish opening before unloading.
      The cabin cannot safely carry a trolley across a half-open threshold. Leave
      this card at the panel so the next shift knows what was actually repaired."
    bodyVietnamese: "Ghi b\u1EA3o tr\xEC \u2014 Maya Reed. Thang h\xE0ng nh\u1EADn
      l\u1EC7nh t\u1EA7ng d\u01B0\u1EDBi sau th\xF4ng b\xE1o \u0111\xF3ng c\u1EEDa
      c\xF4ng khai. Kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\u1ED7i: B2 v\u1EABn n\u1ED1i m\u1EA1ch kh\u1EA9n
      c\u1EA5p. T\xF4i thay \u0111\xE8n s\u1EA3nh, kh\xF4ng thay \u0111\u1EA7u \u0111\u1ECDc
      th\u1EBB. \u0110\u1EEBng y\xEAu c\u1EA7u m\u1EDF kh\xF3a t\u1ED5ng n\u1EEFa;
      an ninh gi\u1EEF th\u1EBB c\xF3 l\xFD do. Khi xu\u1ED1ng, \u0111\u1EE3i c\u1EEDa
      nh\u1EADn m\u1EDF h\u1EBFt m\u1EDBi d\u1EE1 h\xE0ng. Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 an to\xE0n
      \u0111\u1EA9y xe qua ng\u01B0\u1EE1ng c\u1EEDa m\u1EDF n\u1EEDa ch\u1EEBng.
      \u0110\u1EC3 phi\u1EBFu t\u1EA1i b\u1EA3ng \u0111\u1EC3 ca sau bi\u1EBFt th\u1EE9
      g\xEC th\u1EF1c s\u1EF1 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c s\u1EEDa."
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6dda5a7e72c37ac4c92f1e6cc411bec0, type: 3}
