  - id: 17
    chapter: 2
    required: 0
    title: Operator Shutdown Checklist
    summary: 'Before leaving the operations desk, record the active run, preserve
      its index and place any unsigned stop-work request with the original archive.
      Do not mark the trial complete merely because the sample has moved. Completion
      requires an authorized review of the incident record. Dr. Cole has returned
      this checklist twice with the same annotation: unresolved patient outcomes
      are not empty fields. The client export tool offers a clean summary automatically.
      That summary is a delivery convenience only. It must never replace the underlying
      record or become the only copy available to the next operator.'
    body: 'Before leaving the operations desk, record the active run, preserve its
      index and place any unsigned stop-work request with the original archive. Do
      not mark the trial complete merely because the sample has moved. Completion
      requires an authorized review of the incident record. Dr. Cole has returned
      this checklist twice with the same annotation: unresolved patient outcomes
      are not empty fields. The client export tool offers a clean summary automatically.
      That summary is a delivery convenience only. It must never replace the underlying
      record or become the only copy available to the next operator.'
    bodyVietnamese: "Tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi r\u1EDDi b\xE0n v\u1EADn h\xE0nh, ghi l\u01B0\u1EE3t
      ch\u1EA1y, gi\u1EEF ch\u1EC9 m\u1EE5c v\xE0 \u0111\u1EB7t y\xEAu c\u1EA7u d\u1EEBng
      ch\u01B0a k\xFD c\xF9ng h\u1ED3 s\u01A1 g\u1ED1c. Kh\xF4ng \u0111\xE1nh d\u1EA5u
      ho\xE0n t\u1EA5t ch\u1EC9 v\xEC m\u1EABu \u0111\xE3 chuy\u1EC3n. Ho\xE0n t\u1EA5t
      c\u1EA7n th\u1EA9m tra c\xF3 th\u1EA9m quy\u1EC1n. Dr. Cole tr\u1EA3 phi\u1EBFu
      hai l\u1EA7n v\u1EDBi c\xF9ng ghi ch\xFA: s\u1ED1 ph\u1EADn b\u1EC7nh nh\xE2n
      ch\u01B0a r\xF5 kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i \xF4 tr\u1ED1ng. C\xF4ng c\u1EE5 xu\u1EA5t
      cho kh\xE1ch t\u1EF1 t\u1EA1o b\u1EA3n t\xF3m t\u1EAFt s\u1EA1ch. B\u1EA3n
      \u0111\xF3 ch\u1EC9 ti\u1EC7n giao nh\u1EADn, kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      thay d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u g\u1ED1c ho\u1EB7c tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh b\u1EA3n duy nh\u1EA5t
      cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi v\u1EADn h\xE0nh ti\u1EBFp theo."
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6dda5a7e72c37ac4c92f1e6cc411bec0, type: 3}
    preview: {fileID: 0}
    autoDiscoverAfter: 0
    order: 17
  - id: 18
    chapter: 2
    required: 0
    title: Contractor Export Email
    summary: 'From: Contract Liaison. Subject: delivery scope. The receiving client
      expects material identifiers, storage condition and a confirmation of sample
      custody. Patient names, ward correspondence and internal objections fall outside
      the requested export. Please use the abbreviated profile already installed
      on the archive terminal. Reply from Adrian Cole: those fields establish what
      happened here. Omitting them changes the meaning of the result. I will not
      certify a sample-only record as the original. Forwarded response: certification
      can be resolved after collection. Keep this discussion off the public incident
      channel until our client has reviewed the package.'
    body: 'From: Contract Liaison. Subject: delivery scope. The receiving client
      expects material identifiers, storage condition and a confirmation of sample
      custody. Patient names, ward correspondence and internal objections fall outside
      the requested export. Please use the abbreviated profile already installed
      on the archive terminal. Reply from Adrian Cole: those fields establish what
      happened here. Omitting them changes the meaning of the result. I will not
      certify a sample-only record as the original. Forwarded response: certification
      can be resolved after collection. Keep this discussion off the public incident
      channel until our client has reviewed the package.'
    bodyVietnamese: "T\u1EEB: li\xEAn l\u1EA1c h\u1EE3p \u0111\u1ED3ng. Ch\u1EE7
      \u0111\u1EC1: ph\u1EA1m vi giao. Kh\xE1ch ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n m\xE3 v\u1EADt
      li\u1EC7u, \u0111i\u1EC1u ki\u1EC7n l\u01B0u v\xE0 x\xE1c nh\u1EADn gi\u1EEF
      m\u1EABu. T\xEAn b\u1EC7nh nh\xE2n, th\u01B0 khoa v\xE0 ph\u1EA3n \u0111\u1ED1i
      n\u1ED9i b\u1ED9 n\u1EB1m ngo\xE0i b\u1EA3n xu\u1EA5t \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c y\xEAu
      c\u1EA7u. D\xF9ng c\u1EA5u h\xECnh r\xFAt g\u1ECDn \u0111\xE3 c\xE0i tr\xEAn
      m\xE1y l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF. Adrian Cole tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi: c\xE1c tr\u01B0\u1EDDng
      \u0111\xF3 ch\u1EE9ng minh chuy\u1EC7n x\u1EA3y ra; b\u1ECF ch\xFAng l\xE0m
      \u0111\u1ED5i \xFD ngh\u0129a. T\xF4i kh\xF4ng x\xE1c nh\u1EADn h\u1ED3 s\u01A1
      ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 m\u1EABu l\xE0 b\u1EA3n g\u1ED1c. Ph\u1EA3n h\u1ED3i chuy\u1EC3n
      ti\u1EBFp: c\xF3 th\u1EC3 x\u1EED l\xFD ch\u1EE9ng nh\u1EADn sau thu h\u1ED3i.
      \u0110\u1EEBng \u0111\u01B0a th\u1EA3o lu\u1EADn l\xEAn k\xEAnh s\u1EF1 c\u1ED1
      c\xF4ng khai tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi kh\xE1ch xem g\xF3i."
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6dda5a7e72c37ac4c92f1e6cc411bec0, type: 3}
    preview: {fileID: 0}
    autoDiscoverAfter: 0
    order: 18
  - id: 19
    chapter: 2
    required: 0
    title: Calibration Bench Note
    summary: "Bench note \u2014 do not discard with consumables. The replacement
      display arrives with its brightness set to maximum, which makes an unlit warning
      look active through the scratched cover. Check the diagnostic page before logging
      a fault. This is a display problem, not evidence that containment is operating.
      I have tagged the affected unit and attached yesterday's reading so nobody
      has to reconstruct the comparison from memory. If the archive later shows a
      perfect sequence with no interruptions, compare it with the paper sheet. The
      instruments did not become more reliable when the reporting template changed."
    body: "Bench note \u2014 do not discard with consumables. The replacement display
      arrives with its brightness set to maximum, which makes an unlit warning look
      active through the scratched cover. Check the diagnostic page before logging
      a fault. This is a display problem, not evidence that containment is operating.
      I have tagged the affected unit and attached yesterday's reading so nobody
      has to reconstruct the comparison from memory. If the archive later shows a
      perfect sequence with no interruptions, compare it with the paper sheet. The
      instruments did not become more reliable when the reporting template changed."
    bodyVietnamese: "Ghi t\u1EA1i b\xE0n \u2014 kh\xF4ng v\u1EE9t c\xF9ng v\u1EADt
      t\u01B0. M\xE0n thay th\u1EBF \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ED9 s\xE1ng t\u1ED1i \u0111a
      khi\u1EBFn \u0111\xE8n c\u1EA3nh b\xE1o t\u1EAFt tr\xF4ng nh\u01B0 b\u1EADt
      qua l\u1EDBp ph\u1EE7 x\u01B0\u1EDBc. Ki\u1EC3m tra trang ch\u1EA9n \u0111o\xE1n
      tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi ghi l\u1ED7i. \u0110\xE2y l\xE0 l\u1ED7i hi\u1EC3n th\u1ECB,
      kh\xF4ng ch\u1EE9ng minh h\u1EC7 phong t\u1ECFa ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng. T\xF4i
      \u0111\xE1nh d\u1EA5u m\xE1y v\xE0 \u0111\xEDnh s\u1ED1 \u0111o h\xF4m qua
      \u0111\u1EC3 kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i nh\u1EDB l\u1EA1i. N\u1EBFu h\u1ED3 s\u01A1
      sau n\xE0y cho chu\u1ED7i ho\xE0n h\u1EA3o kh\xF4ng gi\xE1n \u0111o\u1EA1n,
      so v\u1EDBi gi\u1EA5y. Thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB kh\xF4ng \u0111\xE1ng tin h\u01A1n
      ch\u1EC9 v\xEC m\u1EABu b\xE1o c\xE1o \u0111\u1ED5i."
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6dda5a7e72c37ac4c92f1e6cc411bec0, type: 3}
    preview: {fileID: 0}
    autoDiscoverAfter: 0
    order: 19
  - id: 20
    chapter: 2
    required: 0
    title: Emergency Drill Review
    summary: 'Drill review, security copy. Staff reached the freight landing, but
      two teams waited for contradictory clearance messages while the lift stood
      open. A local alarm did not reach the outside coordinator. Corrective action:
      confirm receipt beyond the facility before describing a transmission as delivered.
      A progress bar is not an acknowledgement. Marcus Hale requested an independent
      receiving contact and a printed boarding roster. The client declined the additional
      reporting step as unnecessary delay. This review remains open. Do not close
      it simply because the next drill has been removed from the calendar.'
    body: 'Drill review, security copy. Staff reached the freight landing, but two
      teams waited for contradictory clearance messages while the lift stood open.
      A local alarm did not reach the outside coordinator. Corrective action: confirm
      receipt beyond the facility before describing a transmission as delivered.
      A progress bar is not an acknowledgement. Marcus Hale requested an independent
      receiving contact and a printed boarding roster. The client declined the additional
      reporting step as unnecessary delay. This review remains open. Do not close
      it simply because the next drill has been removed from the calendar.'
    bodyVietnamese: "B\u1EA3n an ninh, \u0111\xE1nh gi\xE1 di\u1EC5n t\u1EADp. Nh\xE2n
      vi\xEAn t\u1EDBi s\u1EA3nh thang h\xE0ng nh\u01B0ng hai \u0111\u1ED9i \u0111\u1EE3i
      ch\u1EC9 th\u1ECB tr\xE1i nhau khi c\u1EEDa m\u1EDF. B\xE1o \u0111\u1ED9ng
      c\u1EE5c b\u1ED9 kh\xF4ng t\u1EDBi \u0111i\u1EC1u ph\u1ED1i ngo\xE0i. Kh\u1EAFc
      ph\u1EE5c: x\xE1c nh\u1EADn b\xEAn ngo\xE0i \u0111\xE3 nh\u1EADn tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      khi b\xE1o truy\u1EC1n th\xE0nh c\xF4ng. Thanh ti\u1EBFn tr\xECnh kh\xF4ng
      ph\u1EA3i x\xE1c nh\u1EADn. Marcus Hale y\xEAu c\u1EA7u \u0111\u1EA7u nh\u1EADn
      \u0111\u1ED9c l\u1EADp v\xE0 danh s\xE1ch l\xEAn thang b\u1EA3n in. Kh\xE1ch
      t\u1EEB ch\u1ED1i v\xEC cho l\xE0 ch\u1EADm tr\u1EC5 kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n thi\u1EBFt.
      \u0110\xE1nh gi\xE1 v\u1EABn m\u1EDF. Kh\xF4ng \u0111\xF3ng ch\u1EC9 v\xEC
      bu\u1ED5i di\u1EC5n t\u1EADp sau b\u1ECB x\xF3a kh\u1ECFi l\u1ECBch."
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6dda5a7e72c37ac4c92f1e6cc411bec0, type: 3}
    preview: {fileID: 0}
    autoDiscoverAfter: 0
    order: 20
  - id: 21
    chapter: 2
    required: 0
    title: Maya's Final Shift Recording
    summary: Personal recorder, final intact segment. This is Maya Reed. I have left
      the power note at the panel and the original maintenance sheets with the archive.
      Cole is still trying to stop the trial. Hale has ordered security to preserve
      the records, even if the client calls again. I can hear the shutters closing
      behind operations. If somebody reaches this desk later, do not trust the small
      export marked complete. The full directory is still here. Take the names with
      the numbers. We worked beside these people; they were never just a shipment.
      End of recovered segment.
    body: Personal recorder, final intact segment. This is Maya Reed. I have left
      the power note at the panel and the original maintenance sheets with the archive.
      Cole is still trying to stop the trial. Hale has ordered security to preserve
      the records, even if the client calls again. I can hear the shutters closing
      behind operations. If somebody reaches this desk later, do not trust the small
      export marked complete. The full directory is still here. Take the names with
      the numbers. We worked beside these people; they were never just a shipment.
      End of recovered segment.
    bodyVietnamese: "M\xE1y c\xE1 nh\xE2n, \u0111o\u1EA1n nguy\xEAn v\u1EB9n cu\u1ED1i.
      T\xF4i l\xE0 Maya Reed. Ghi ch\xFA \u0111i\u1EC7n \u1EDF b\u1EA3ng, gi\u1EA5y
      b\u1EA3o tr\xEC g\u1ED1c c\xF9ng h\u1ED3 s\u01A1. Cole v\u1EABn c\u1ED1 d\u1EEBng
      th\u1EED nghi\u1EC7m. Hale l\u1EC7nh an ninh gi\u1EEF h\u1ED3 s\u01A1 d\xF9
      kh\xE1ch g\u1ECDi n\u1EEFa. T\xF4i nghe c\u1EEDa phong t\u1ECFa \u0111\xF3ng
      sau ph\xF2ng v\u1EADn h\xE0nh. N\u1EBFu ai t\u1EDBi b\xE0n n\xE0y sau, \u0111\u1EEBng
      tin b\u1EA3n xu\u1EA5t nh\u1ECF \u0111\xE1nh d\u1EA5u ho\xE0n t\u1EA5t. Th\u01B0
      m\u1EE5c \u0111\u1EA7y \u0111\u1EE7 v\u1EABn \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y. Mang theo
      t\xEAn c\xF9ng c\xE1c con s\u1ED1. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i l\xE0m vi\u1EC7c b\xEAn
      h\u1ECD; h\u1ECD ch\u01B0a bao gi\u1EDD ch\u1EC9 l\xE0 m\u1ED9t chuy\u1EBFn
      h\xE0ng. H\u1EBFt \u0111o\u1EA1n kh\xF4i ph\u1EE5c."
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6dda5a7e72c37ac4c92f1e6cc411bec0, type: 3}
    preview: {fileID: 0}
    autoDiscoverAfter: 0
