  - id: 2
    chapter: 1
    title: SERVICE FUSE
    description: Replacement fuse for An Lac's lower service panel. Any living squad
      member may install it at the panel. Consumed only after a successful installation.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: afb7d6c1e0ece31498ae94abe1ad230d, type: 3}
