  - id: 3
    chapter: 1
    title: B2 ACCESS CARD
    description: Security card retained with the P046 transfer discrepancy. Enables
      the freight lift's B2 call at its reader. Removed from team items once the
      lift authorization is committed.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 63641263d1b2ca64eaf1c0865d0cfcff, type: 3}
