  - id: 4
    chapter: 2
    title: E-02 LABORATORY EVIDENCE CASE
    description: 'Sealed original archive: T9-17, C12, P046 and the unredacted identity
      table. The transmitted copy supplements this original; it does not consume
      the case.'
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 20477921fd0efc146aa9752d76a2acc7, type: 3}
    acquiredAfter: 19
    consumedAfter: 0
    persistAfterUse: 1
    order: 4
  dialogue:
  - id: 1
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: Vanguard, this is Mira Shaw, BRT coordination. The helicopter leaves
      after insertion. Recover the T9-17 case and its records. We need evidence,
      not a sample-only receipt.
    vietnamese: "Vanguard, \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 Mira Shaw, \u0111i\u1EC1u ph\u1ED1i
      BRT. Tr\u1EF1c th\u0103ng r\u1EDDi \u0111i sau khi th\u1EA3 \u0111\u1ED9i.
      Thu h\u1ED3i ki\u1EC7n T9-17 c\xF9ng h\u1ED3 s\u01A1. Ta c\u1EA7n b\u1EB1ng
      ch\u1EE9ng, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i bi\xEAn nh\u1EADn ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 m\u1EABu."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 1
    trigger: Insertion
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 2
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: Cold Ledger. Restore cold-store power and reconcile the logistics release.
      Both branches are required; take them in either order.
    vietnamese: "Cold Ledger. Kh\xF4i ph\u1EE5c \u0111i\u1EC7n kho l\u1EA1nh v\xE0
      \u0111\u1ED1i chi\u1EBFu v\u1EADn chuy\u1EC3n. C\u1EA7n c\u1EA3 hai nh\xE1nh,
      th\u1EE9 t\u1EF1 t\xF9y \u0111\u1ED9i."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 1
    trigger: Factory/Exploring
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 3
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: An Lac Care Institute. Those Who Never Left. The factory case stays
      with Vanguard. Start with the security desk; find who received that shipment.
    vietnamese: "An Lac Care Institute. Those Who Never Left. Gi\u1EEF ki\u1EC7n
      nh\xE0 m\xE1y c\xF9ng Vanguard. B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u t\u1EA1i b\xE0n an ninh,
      t\xECm ng\u01B0\u1EDDi nh\u1EADn chuy\u1EBFn \u0111\xF3."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 1
    trigger: Asylum/Exploring
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 4
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: The Unmapped Floor. B2 is below the institute, absent from its public
      plans. Trace P046 and find the unredacted E-02 archive.
    vietnamese: "The Unmapped Floor. B2 d\u01B0\u1EDBi vi\u1EC7n, kh\xF4ng c\xF3
      tr\xEAn s\u01A1 \u0111\u1ED3 c\xF4ng khai. Theo d\u1EA5u P046 v\xE0 t\xECm
      E-02 nguy\xEAn b\u1EA3n."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 1
    trigger: Laboratory/Exploring
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 5
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: Backup power is stable. Preserve the seal and verify the logistics release
      before collecting T9-17.
    vietnamese: "Ngu\u1ED3n d\u1EF1 ph\xF2ng \u1ED5n \u0111\u1ECBnh. Gi\u1EEF ni\xEAm
      phong, ki\u1EC3m tra v\u1EADn chuy\u1EC3n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi l\u1EA5y T9-17."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 1
    trigger: FactoryGenerator
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 6
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: AL-04, K6, An Lac at 02:40. That destination was missing from the client's
      recovery order. Keep the original manifest.
    vietnamese: "AL-04, K6, An Lac l\xFAc 02:40. L\u1EC7nh thu h\u1ED3i c\u1EE7a
      kh\xE1ch thi\u1EBFu \u0111\u1ECBa ch\u1EC9 \u0111\xF3. Gi\u1EEF v\u1EADn \u0111\u01A1n
      g\u1ED1c."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 1
    trigger: FactoryShipping
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 7
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: T9-17 is secured. The addendum names B2 beneath An Lac. Use the service
      route and keep the case sealed.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xE3 gi\u1EEF T9-17. Ph\u1EE5 l\u1EE5c ch\u1EC9 t\u1EDBi B2
      d\u01B0\u1EDBi An Lac. \u0110i tuy\u1EBFn d\u1ECBch v\u1EE5, gi\u1EEF ki\u1EC7n
      ni\xEAm phong."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 1
    trigger: FactoryCase
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 8
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: C12 and 02:40 match the factory manifest. Restore service power and
      check the upper patient records.
    vietnamese: "C12 v\xE0 02:40 kh\u1EDBp v\u1EADn \u0111\u01A1n nh\xE0 m\xE1y.
      Kh\xF4i ph\u1EE5c ngu\u1ED3n d\u1ECBch v\u1EE5, ki\u1EC3m tra h\u1ED3 s\u01A1
      b\u1EC7nh nh\xE2n t\u1EA7ng tr\xEAn."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 1
    trigger: AsylumAccess
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 9
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: Service power is restored. The records room is accessible. The freight
      lift still needs security's B2 card.
    vietnamese: "Ngu\u1ED3n d\u1ECBch v\u1EE5 \u0111\xE3 c\xF3. C\xF3 th\u1EC3 v\xE0o
      ph\xF2ng h\u1ED3 s\u01A1. Thang h\xE0ng v\u1EABn c\u1EA7n th\u1EBB B2 c\u1EE7a
      an ninh."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 1
    trigger: AsylumPower
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 10
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: P046 matches the intake. The public recovery entry points somewhere
      else internally. Cross-check the mortuary transfer.
    vietnamese: "P046 kh\u1EDBp ti\u1EBFp nh\u1EADn. M\u1EE5c ph\u1EE5c h\u1ED3i
      c\xF4ng khai l\u1EA1i ch\u1EC9 n\u01A1i kh\xE1c trong n\u1ED9i b\u1ED9. \u0110\u1ED1i
      chi\u1EBFu h\u1ED3 s\u01A1 nh\xE0 x\xE1c."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 1
    trigger: AsylumPatient
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 11
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: Death at 03:05, live transfer at 03:50. Preserve both entries. The B2
      card gives you the route they concealed.
    vietnamese: "T\u1EED vong 03:05, chuy\u1EC3n c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng 03:50. Gi\u1EEF
      c\u1EA3 hai m\u1EE5c. Th\u1EBB B2 m\u1EDF tuy\u1EBFn h\u1ECD che gi\u1EA5u."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 1
    trigger: AsylumTransfer
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 12
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: Safety, data and freight lift are live. The test rig stays off. Recover
      the original record.
    vietnamese: "An to\xE0n, d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u v\xE0 thang h\xE0ng \u0111\xE3 b\u1EADt.
      Gi\u1EEF gi\xE0n th\u1EED t\u1EAFt. Thu h\u1ED3i h\u1ED3 s\u01A1 g\u1ED1c."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 1
    trigger: LabPower
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 13
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: E-02 confirms T9-17, C12 and P046. Cole, Hale and Reed are confirmed
      dead in the incident ledger. Their records are what we can bring out.
    vietnamese: "E-02 x\xE1c nh\u1EADn T9-17, C12 v\xE0 P046. S\u1ED5 s\u1EF1 c\u1ED1
      x\xE1c nh\u1EADn Cole, Hale v\xE0 Reed t\u1EED vong. H\u1ED3 s\u01A1 c\u1EE7a
      h\u1ECD l\xE0 th\u1EE9 ta c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0a ra."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 1
    trigger: LabArchive
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 14
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: Both cases are secured. Copy the full archive to BRT custody before
      you leave.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xE3 gi\u1EEF c\u1EA3 hai ki\u1EC7n. Sao ch\xE9p to\xE0n b\u1ED9
      h\u1ED3 s\u01A1 t\u1EDBi BRT tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi r\u1EDDi \u0111i."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 1
    trigger: LabCase
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 15
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: Service interlock is cycling. Hold the control room; the route will
      wait for the living squad.
    vietnamese: "Kh\xF3a d\u1ECBch v\u1EE5 \u0111ang ch\u1EA1y chu tr\xECnh. Gi\u1EEF
      ph\xF2ng \u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n, tuy\u1EBFn s\u1EBD \u0111\u1EE3i c\xE1c
      th\xE0nh vi\xEAn c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 1
    trigger: Factory/Encounter
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 16
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: The B2 lift is cycling. You can evade the Tank. Keep the route to the
      landing clear and recover anyone downed.
    vietnamese: "Thang B2 \u0111ang ch\u1EA1y. C\xF3 th\u1EC3 n\xE9 Tank. Gi\u1EEF
      tuy\u1EBFn t\u1EDBi s\u1EA3nh th\xF4ng v\xE0 c\u1EE9u ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1ECB
      h\u1EA1."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 1
    trigger: Asylum/Encounter
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 17
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: Transmission is running. Keep moving and cover the data path. You do
      not need to kill the Tank to leave.
    vietnamese: "\u0110ang truy\u1EC1n. Ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c di chuy\u1EC3n, b\u1EA3o
      v\u1EC7 \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u. Kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n h\u1EA1 Tank
      \u0111\u1EC3 tho\xE1t."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 1
    trigger: Laboratory/Encounter
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 18
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: The route is ready. Bring every living operator into the boarding zone
      and hold together. Revive anyone downed first.
    vietnamese: "Tuy\u1EBFn s\u1EB5n s\xE0ng. \u0110\u01B0a m\u1ECDi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng v\xE0o v\xF9ng l\xEAn thang v\xE0 gi\u1EEF c\xF9ng nhau. C\u1EE9u
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1ECB h\u1EA1 tr\u01B0\u1EDBc."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 0
    trigger: AwaitingParty
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 19
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: Cabin secured. Descending to B2. Wait for the receiving door before
      moving out.
    vietnamese: "Khoang \u0111\xE3 kh\xF3a. \u0110ang xu\u1ED1ng B2. \u0110\u1EE3i
      c\u1EEDa nh\u1EADn r\u1ED3i m\u1EDBi ra."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 1
    trigger: Asylum/Transitioning
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 20
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: Vanguard is clear with both cases. The complete copy is in BRT custody.
      The facility remains quarantined. We have the evidence; the investigation starts
      now.
    vietnamese: "Vanguard ra ngo\xE0i c\xF9ng hai ki\u1EC7n. BRT gi\u1EEF b\u1EA3n
      sao \u0111\u1EA7y \u0111\u1EE7. C\u01A1 s\u1EDF v\u1EABn phong t\u1ECFa. \u0110\xE3
      c\xF3 b\u1EB1ng ch\u1EE9ng; \u0111i\u1EC1u tra b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 1
    trigger: Completed
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 21
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: Complete copy received outside the facility. Patient records included.
      Keep both cases and board the freight lift.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xE3 nh\u1EADn b\u1EA3n sao \u0111\u1EA7y \u0111\u1EE7 b\xEAn
      ngo\xE0i, g\u1ED3m h\u1ED3 s\u01A1 b\u1EC7nh nh\xE2n. Gi\u1EEF hai ki\u1EC7n
      v\xE0 l\xEAn thang h\xE0ng."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 1
    trigger: EvidenceTransmitted
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 22
    speaker: Anonymous Client
    english: Retain the sample. Remove patient identities and internal objections
      before transmission. Deliver the abbreviated package. That is the contract.
    vietnamese: "Gi\u1EEF m\u1EABu. X\xF3a danh t\xEDnh b\u1EC7nh nh\xE2n v\xE0 ph\u1EA3n
      \u0111\u1ED1i n\u1ED9i b\u1ED9 tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi truy\u1EC1n. Giao g\xF3i
      r\xFAt g\u1ECDn. H\u1EE3p \u0111\u1ED3ng y\xEAu c\u1EA7u v\u1EADy."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 1
    trigger: LabTransmit
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 23
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: That is a concealment order, not a BRT directive. Preserve the original
      and transmit everything, including patient data. I will confirm receipt outside.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xF3 l\xE0 l\u1EC7nh che gi\u1EA5u, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i ch\u1EC9
      th\u1ECB BRT. Gi\u1EEF b\u1EA3n g\u1ED1c, truy\u1EC1n t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 k\u1EC3
      c\u1EA3 d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u b\u1EC7nh nh\xE2n. T\xF4i x\xE1c nh\u1EADn nh\u1EADn
      b\xEAn ngo\xE0i."
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
    oncePerRun: 1
    trigger: LabTransmit/AfterClientOrder
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 24
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: Operator down. Cover the approach and get them back on their feet.
    vietnamese: "C\xF3 \u0111\u1EB7c v\u1EE5 b\u1ECB h\u1EA1. Y\u1EC3m tr\u1EE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng
      t\u1EDBi v\xE0 c\u1EE9u h\u1ECD."
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 12
    oncePerRun: 0
    trigger: LifeState/Downed
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 25
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: Tank contact. Make room; do not let it pin the squad in a corridor.
    vietnamese: "G\u1EB7p Tank. Gi\xE3n \u0111\u1ED9i h\xECnh, \u0111\u1EEBng \u0111\u1EC3
      n\xF3 \xE9p c\u1EA3 \u0111\u1ED9i trong h\xE0nh lang."
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 12
    oncePerRun: 0
    trigger: Special/Tank
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 26
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: Screamer nearby. Watch the flanks and listen for the call.
    vietnamese: "C\xF3 Screamer g\u1EA7n \u0111\xE2y. C\u1EA3nh gi\u1EDBi hai b\xEAn
      v\xE0 nghe ti\u1EBFng g\u1ECDi."
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 12
    oncePerRun: 0
    trigger: Special/Screamer
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 27
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: Infector contact. Avoid exposure and keep a clear retreat.
    vietnamese: "G\u1EB7p Infector. Tr\xE1nh ph\u01A1i nhi\u1EC5m, gi\u1EEF \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng
      r\xFAt."
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 12
    oncePerRun: 0
    trigger: Special/Infector
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: 28
    speaker: Mira Shaw
    english: Operator recovered. Regroup before pushing forward.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EB7c v\u1EE5 \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c c\u1EE9u. T\u1EADp
      h\u1EE3p tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi ti\u1EBFn."
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 12
    oncePerRun: 0
    trigger: LifeState/Revived
    audio: {fileID: 0}
  objectives:
  - id: 1
    title: ISOLATE PRODUCTION
    instructions: Open the production breaker. Keep the cold store connected to its
      backup circuit.
    hint: Start with the west breaker marked PRODUCTION.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 1
  - id: 2
    title: BACKUP COLD STORE
    instructions: Engage the cold-store backup feed after isolating production.
    hint: The east breaker feeds the cold store; do not restart production.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 1
  - id: 3
    title: START GENERATOR
    instructions: Start the generator only after the backup cold-store feed is engaged.
    hint: Check the physical switch, not just the green lamp.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 1
  - id: 4
    title: READ DELIVERY MANIFEST
    instructions: Record the AL-04 manifest before reconciling the shipping release.
    hint: Compare shipment, seal and receiving time.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 2
  - id: 5
    title: VERIFY SHIPPING RELEASE
    instructions: Select the shipment and seal, then its destination and receiving
      time.
    hint: Match AL-04 / K6 with AN LAC / 02:40.
    choices:
    - AL-03 / K9
    - AL-04 / K6
    - AL-07 / K2
    secondaryChoices:
    - NORTH DEPOT / 06:10
    - AN LAC / 02:40
    - AN LAC / 04:20
    file: 2
  - id: 6
    title: SECURE T9-17 CASE
    instructions: Secure the returned case and its B2 transfer addendum. Preserve
      the seal.
    hint: Complete Utilities and Logistics, then clear the Tank threat before collection.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 3
  - id: 7
    title: OPEN SERVICE ROUTE
    instructions: Activate the service interlock. Prepare with the squad before beginning
      the hold.
    hint: Gather living operators at the panel and confirm readiness.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 0
  - id: 8
    title: READ SECURITY DESK LOG
    instructions: Record the technical intake hidden behind the public admissions
      log.
    hint: Group C12 arrived at 02:40; the upper room holds the patient sheet.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 4
  - id: 9
    title: RECOVER SERVICE FUSE
    instructions: Recover the spare fuse from ground-floor maintenance storage.
    hint: The fuse is shared by the squad and can be installed by any living operator.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 0
  - id: 10
    title: INSTALL SERVICE FUSE
    instructions: Install the recovered fuse at the lower service panel.
    hint: Read the desk log and recover the fuse; neither is consumed by a wrong
      interaction.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 0
  - id: 11
    title: RESTORE SERVICE POWER
    instructions: Bring the lower service circuit online after fitting the replacement
      fuse.
    hint: The upper records room needs this circuit.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 0
  - id: 12
    title: IDENTIFY PATIENT
    instructions: Select the record matching the desk log's group and receiving time.
    hint: 'Match all three fields: P046 / C12 / 02:40.'
    choices:
    - P041 / C08 / 01:20
    - P046 / C12 / 02:40
    - P064 / C12 / 04:20
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 5
  - id: 13
    title: VERIFY MORTUARY TRANSFER
    instructions: Select the discrepancy that requires independent review. Retain
      the B2 card with the report.
    hint: The same reference is listed dead before its live transfer.
    choices:
    - 'CONTRADICTION: DEATH 03:05 / LIVE TRANSFER 03:50'
    - 'CONSISTENT: DEATH FOLLOWED BY BODY COLLECTION'
    - UNRELATED PATIENTS WITH SIMILAR REFERENCES
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 6
  - id: 14
    title: CALL B2 FREIGHT LIFT
    instructions: Scan the B2 card. Prepare for the lift cycle and board with the
      squad.
    hint: The card is spent at this panel; it cannot be used remotely from Inventory.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 0
  - id: 15
    title: TRACE B2 TRANSFER
    instructions: Trace the institute transfer into the laboratory index.
    hint: Follow T9-17, C12 and P046 together, not a sample identifier alone.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 7
  - id: 16
    title: READ ARCHIVE INDEX
    instructions: Record the original-archive directory before searching the terminal.
    hint: E-02 is the unredacted original, not the contractor export.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 7
  - id: 17
    title: ALLOCATE EMERGENCY POWER
    instructions: 'Keep SAFETY online. Disable TEST RIG before enabling DATA and
      FREIGHT LIFT. Capacity: six units.'
    hint: SAFETY + DATA + FREIGHT LIFT = 2 + 2 + 2. TEST RIG stays off.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 8
  - id: 18
    title: VERIFY ORIGINAL ARCHIVE
    instructions: Select the archive matching all three identifiers and preserve
      its identity table.
    hint: Choose E-02 / T9-17 / C12 / P046.
    choices:
    - E-01 / T9-03 / C08
    - E-02 / T9-17 / C12 / P046
    - E-03 / EQUIPMENT ONLY
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 9
  - id: 19
    title: SECURE E-02 CASE
    instructions: Secure the original archive in the laboratory evidence case. Retain
      the factory case as well.
    hint: The original must be verified before the sealed case is released.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 9
  - id: 20
    title: TRANSMIT COMPLETE EVIDENCE
    instructions: Prepare the squad, transmit a complete copy to BRT custody and
      call the freight lift. Do not delete patient fields.
    hint: Keep both original cases. Transmission does not require eliminating every
      infected.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 9
